#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:5
msgid "How It Works - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Kusebenza kanjani - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:172
msgid ""
"From spotting symptoms to getting recommendations and connecting with vets—"
"here's your step-by-step guide to CattleCare AI."
msgstr ""
"Kusukela ekuboneni izimpawu kuze kuthola izincomo nokuxhumana nezingcweti—"
"nansi izikhombisi zakho zenyathelo nenyathelo ku-CattleCare AI."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:179
msgid "Simple, Clear Process"
msgstr "Indlela Elula, Ecacileyo"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:180
msgid ""
"You don't need technical skills. Register once, then submit cases whenever "
"you notice something wrong with your cattle. Our AI and vet network do the "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"Awudingi ikhono lobuchwepheshe. Bhalisa kanye, bese ulandelisa izigameko "
"noma nini lapho ubona into engalungile izinkomo zakho. I-AI yethu kanye "
"nohlelo lwezinyanga zezilwane bazokwenza okunye."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:185
msgid "Register once"
msgstr "Bhalisa kanye"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:186
msgid ""
"Create your farmer account with your contact details and location. It's free "
"and only takes a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Dala i-akhawunti yakho yomlimi nemininingwane yokuxhumana kanye nendawo. "
"Mahhala futhi kuthatha iminitsi embalwa nje."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:192
msgid "Submit when needed"
msgstr "Thumela uma kudingeka"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:193
msgid ""
"Whenever you see symptoms, log in and fill in our guided form. No need to "
"wait for office hours."
msgstr ""
"Nganoma nini ubona izimpawu, ngena ugcwalise ifomu lethu elikhomba indlela. "
"Akudingeki ukulinda amahora ehhovisi."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:199
msgid "AI + vets"
msgstr "AI + izingcweti"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:200
msgid ""
"Get an instant prediction and recommendations. For serious cases, choose a "
"vet from your region."
msgstr ""
"Thola ukubiselezwa nezincomo ngokushesha. Kwamacansi abalulekile, khetha "
"ingcweti evela kwindawo yakho."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:206
msgid "Track history"
msgstr "Landela umlando"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:207
msgid ""
"All your cases are saved. Review past predictions and treatments anytime "
"from your dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Wonke amacansi akho alondolozwe. Bhuqa izinhloso zowedlule nezindlela "
"zokwelapha nganoma nini ku-deshibhodi yakho."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:217
msgid "The Four Steps in Detail"
msgstr "Izigaba Ezine Ngokuningiliziwe"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:218
msgid "What happens after you submit a case."
msgstr "Okwenzakalayo ngemva kokufaka isigameko."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:224
msgid ""
"Describe what you see: behaviour changes, appetite, skin, eyes, breathing, "
"etc. You can add age, breed, and herd size. The more accurate the "
"information, the better the prediction."
msgstr ""
"Chaza lokho okubonayo: izinguquko zokuziphatha, izifiso zokudla, isikhumba, "
"amehlo, ukuphefumula, njll. Ungengeza iminyaka, uhlobo, kanye nobukhulu "
"bomhlambi. Imininingwane eyiqiniso inezinhloso ezinhle."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:231
msgid ""
"Our machine learning models (trained on cattle disease data) analyze the "
"symptoms and return the most likely disease with a confidence score. This "
"usually takes only a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Imodeli zethu zokufunda kwemishini (eqeqeshwe ngedatha yezigulo zezinkomo) "
"zihlaziya izimpawu bese zibuya nefo elingenzeka kakhulu ngesikali "
"sokwethemba. Lokhu kuvame ukuthatha amasekhondi ambalwa kuphela."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:238
msgid ""
"You receive treatment suggestions, quarantine steps, and preventive measures "
"tailored to the predicted condition. Follow them while considering your "
"vet's advice for serious cases."
msgstr ""
"Amukela izincomo zokwelapha, izinyathelo zokuqhamuka, kanye nezindlela "
"zokuvikela ezilungiselelwe isimo esibiselezwayo. Zilandele ukhumbula "
"iseluleko sendokotela yakho kwamacansi abalulekile."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:245
msgid ""
"For severe or critical cases, the platform lets you choose a Ministry-"
"approved vet in your province. You can request a consultation so the vet can "
"advise or visit when needed."
msgstr ""
"Kwamacansi abalulekile noma abaluleke kakhulu, indawo ikuvumela ukukhetha "
"ingcweti evunyelwe yi-Ministry esifundazweni sakho. Ungacela ukubonisana "
"ukuze ingcweti ikunike iseluleko noma ihamele uma kudingeka."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:255
msgid "What You Need to Get Started"
msgstr "Lokho Okudingekayo Ukuqala"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:256
msgid "A few things that help you get the most out of CattleCare AI."
msgstr "Izinto ezimbalwa ezikusiza ukuthola okuningi ku-CattleCare AI."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:261
msgid "Device and internet"
msgstr "Idivayisi kanye ne-inthanethi"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:262
msgid ""
"Use a smartphone, tablet, or computer with internet access. The platform "
"works in the browser—no app install required."
msgstr ""
"Sebenzisa ucingo oluhlakaniphile, ithebhulethi, noma ikhompyutha "
"enofinyelelo ku-inthanethi. Inkundla isebenza kubhrawuza—akukho uhlelo "
"lokusebenza oludingekayo ukufakwa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:268
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "Ukubheka"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:269
msgid ""
"Note what you see in your cattle: symptoms, duration, and how many animals "
"are affected. Clear descriptions improve prediction accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Bhala lokho okubona enkomo yakho: izimpawu, isikhathi, kanye nezilwane "
"ezingaki ezichatshaziwe. Izincazelo ezicacile zithuthukisa ukulungeka "
"kokulinga."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:276
msgid ""
"Your province and district help us match you with nearby vets and contribute "
"to national disease surveillance."
msgstr ""
"Isifundazwe sakho nesigodi kusisiza ukukufanisa nezinyanga zezilwane "
"eziseduze futhi kufaka isandla ekuqapheleni izifo emazweni."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:286
msgid "Tips for Best Results"
msgstr "Amacebo emiphumela Emihle"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:287
msgid ""
"Follow these practices to get the most accurate predictions and useful "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Landela lezi zindlela ukuthola izinhloso ezilungekile kakhulu nezeluleko "
"ezisizayo."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:292
msgid "Be as specific as you can"
msgstr "Yiba nokuqondile ngangokunokwenzeka"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:293
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Mention all relevant symptoms (e.g. fever, cough, lameness, loss of "
#| "appetite). Include how long they've been present and whether multiple "
#| "animals are affected. This helps the AI narrow down the likely disease."
msgid ""
"Mention all relevant symptoms (e.g. fever, cough, lameness, loss of "
"appetite). Include how long they’ve been present and whether multiple "
"animals are affected. This helps the AI narrow down the likely disease."
msgstr ""
"Shono zonke izimpawu ezibalulekile (isb. umkhuhlane, ukukhwehlela, ukulamba, "
"ukungafuni ukudla). Faka isikhathi ezikhona ngaso nokuthi izilwane eziningi "
"zikhona. Lokhu kusiza i-AI ukunciphisa ifo elingelokwenzeka."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:299
msgid "When to involve a vet"
msgstr "Nini ukukhomba ingcweti"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:300
msgid ""
"For critical or severe cases, or when the recommendation suggests "
"professional care, use the vet connection feature. Don't rely on prediction "
"alone for life-threatening or unclear situations."
msgstr ""
"Kwamacansi abalulekile noma abaluleke kakhulu, noma lapho incomo ikhomba "
"ukunakekelwa ngobuchwepheshe, sebenzisa isici sokuxhumana nezingcweti. "
"Ungathembeli kuphela ekulingeni kwazo zonke izimo ezisingcongo noma "
"eziconfused."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:310
msgid "Ready to start?"
msgstr "Ulungele ukuqala?"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:311
msgid "Register as a farmer and submit your first case in minutes."
msgstr "Bhalisa njengomulimi bese uthumela icansi lakho lokuqala ngemaminitsi."

